    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 36 Oak Park Malahide, a superb three-bedroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development. Formerly the show house for the estate, this beautifully presented home benefits from well-proportioned layout, quality finishes and an enviable position directly overlooking a large communal green.\r\n\r\nThis impressive A2-rated property has thoughtfully designed accommodation throughout. On entering, there is a welcoming entrance hallway with storage and guest WC, leading into a bright and spacious lounge with sliding doors leading into a superb open-plan style kitchen and dining area, featuring a fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, a separate fitted utility room and access directly onto a recently landscaped rear garden. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms with the master bedroom further enhanced by a private ensuite & a walk in wardrobe. A well-appointed family bathroom completes the first floor. The property also benefits from a large attic space which is suitable for conversion offering excellent potential to create additional accommodation"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t5.62 x 2.0\tHerringbone timber floor, understair storage\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\t1.51 x 1.55\tTiled floor and partial tiled walls, wc, whb, holders, Villeroy & bosch sanitaryware\r\n \r\nLounge\t3.86 x 3.98 (into bay)\tHerringbone timber floor, feature wall panelling, sliding doors leading into a modern open plan kitchen / diner\r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen / dining room\t5.30 x 5.95\tHerringbone timber floor, fully fitted kitchen, frankie sink, contemporary handleless kitchen doors, reconstituted stone worktops and splashback, integrated appliances, double doors leading to a beautifully landscaped rear garden\r\n\t\t\r\nUtility\t\tShelving, plumbed for washer and dryer\r\n \r\nStairs/Landing\t\tLarge hot press, access to attic\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t3.0 x 4.13\tCarpet floor\r\n\r\nWalk in wardrobe\t1.74 x 1.81\tFitted wardrobes \r\n\r\nEnsuite\t1.74 x 1.81\tTiled floor & partial walls, mirror, w.c, w.h.b, villeroy & bosch sanitaryware, Demisting mirror with feature lighting\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t4.16 x 2.98\tCarpet floor, abundance of fitted wardrobes, overlooking green space\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom\t1.74 x 2.33\tBath suite, w.c, w.h.b, shower screen, tiled floor & partial wall, Demisting mirror with feature lighting \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t3.48 x 2.90\tFeature wall panelling, access to a large attic space suitable for conversion, overlooking green space \r\n \r\nGarden\tRecently landscaped, walled and fenced, part deck, part patio, part lawn, raised bedding"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
